:null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev 74de2ec04\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (74de2ec04) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.126.18) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe LightmapGI probe update speed is only set in the editor (according to the project setting value), not in running projects, unless you change it at runtime manually. In other words, the project setting's initial value is not read in Compatibility.\n\nThis issue does not occur in Forward+/Mobile.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add a LightmapGI node in a scene with emissive surfaces.\n- Set the `rendering/lightmapping/probe_capture/update_speed` project setting to a low value like `0.1`.\n- Move a dynamic object around while in the editor. Notice how its indirect light updates slowly.\n- Run the project and do the same object movement. Notice how indirect light updates more quickly (since it uses the default setting in code, equal to `4`).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_lightmap_probe_update_speed.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26196746/test_lightmap_probe_update_speed.zip)\nPress <kbd>Space</kbd> to toggle between low (default) and high update speeds.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117770/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}